layout: base.njk
title: Results
permalink: results.html
---
{%- set cols = results.columns %}
<h1>Results</h1>

<p class="site-lead">How well automated checkers find each test case, then and now. The GOV.UK columns show the 2017 results for aXe and HTML_CodeSniffer. The AIL columns show the 2026 retest with axe-core and pa11y, which uses HTML_CodeSniffer as its engine.</p>

<p><strong>The 2026 retest has not run yet.</strong> Until it has, the AIL columns are empty.</p>

<h2>Summary</h2>
<div class="site-table-wrap" role="region" aria-labelledby="summary-caption" tabindex="0">
<table>
  <caption id="summary-caption">Number of test cases per result, by tool</caption>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col">Result</th>
      {%- for c in cols %}
      <th scope="col">{{ c.label }}<br><span class="site-muted">{{ c.who }} {{ c.when }}</span></th>
      {%- endfor %}
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {%- for value, label in results.values %}
    <tr>
      <th scope="row">{{ label | capitalize }}</th>
      {%- for c in cols %}
      <td>{{ collections.testCases | countResult(results.byTest, c.key, value) }}</td>
      {%- endfor %}
    </tr>
    {%- endfor %}
    <tr>
      <th scope="row">Not tested</th>
      {%- for c in cols %}
      <td>{{ collections.testCases | countResult(results.byTest, c.key, null) }}</td>
      {%- endfor %}
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>

<h2>About the comparison</h2>
<ul>
  <li>GOV.UK last retested aXe on 23 December 2017 and HTML_CodeSniffer on 5 December 2017. Tool versions were not recorded. On 13 April 2018 GOV.UK reclassified HTML_CodeSniffer warnings as manual checks without retesting.</li>
  <li>GOV.UK recorded results by hand. AIL classifies results with a script and a stored mapping from test case to rule IDs, so the categories may not line up exactly.</li>
  <li>Test cases added by AIL have no 2017 result.</li>
  <li>The full GOV.UK results for all 13 tools are on the <a href="{{ site.originalResults }}">original results page</a>.</li>
</ul>

{%- set groups = collections.testCases | groupByCategory %}
<h2>Results per test case</h2>
{%- for group in groups %}
<div class="site-table-wrap" role="region" aria-labelledby="results-{{ loop.index }}" tabindex="0">
<table>
  <caption id="results-{{ loop.index }}">{{ group.name }}</caption>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th scope="col">Test case</th>
      {%- for c in cols %}
      <th scope="col">{{ c.label }}<br><span class="site-muted">{{ c.who }} {{ c.when }}</span></th>
      {%- endfor %}
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {%- for item in group.items %}
    {%- set r = results.byTest[item.fileSlug] %}
    <tr>
      <th scope="row"><a href="{{ ('/tests/' + item.fileSlug + '.html') | url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a>{% if item.data.origin == 'ail-2026' %} <span class="site-muted">(AIL)</span>{% endif %}</th>
      {%- for c in cols %}
      {%- set v = r[c.key] if r else null %}
      <td{% if v %} class="site-result site-result-{{ v }}"{% endif %}>{{ results.values[v] if v else '–' }}</td>
      {%- endfor %}
    </tr>
    {%- endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
